title: Gaokao-Bench
message: Please cite this repository by version when using its code, schema, or reports. Underlying exam material has separate rights and is not covered by the repository license.
type: software
version: 0.1.2
date-released: 2026-11-10
license: Apache-2.0
authors:
  - name: Gaokao-Bench contributors
keywords:
  - gaokao
  - benchmark
  - evaluation
  - mathematics
  - multi-subject
  - education
abstract: A deterministic, point-weighted benchmark toolkit for Chinese Gaokao questions. Engine 0.1.2 separates a subject-neutral harness from versioned benchmark specifications and immutable data packages, with scoped metrics, reproducible provider protocols, resume support, and audited text/vision slices. The current 0.0.3 dataset is a licensing update to 0.0.2, keeping the same 74 choice and fill-in mathematics questions from five 2025 papers. The complete dataset package, including question text, answers, figures, selection, schema, and scoring metadata, is licensed under CC BY 4.0; the harness and code remain Apache-2.0.

